        }
      },
      "time": "native",
      "time_notes": "retain item `timestamp` = session event_time (AMB passes Document.timestamp the same way); recall `query_timestamp` = query_time, the anchor for relative dates and recency. An event_time or query_time without a UTC offset is read as UTC.",
      "granularity": "one retain item per session (content = JSON of the session's turns, as AMB serializes LoCoMo and LongMemEval sessions), document_id = source_id",
      "provenance": {
        "status": "exact",
        "mechanism": "every recall result carries `document_id`, which is the source_id the shim passed to retain; a chunk item takes the document_id of the fact that cites it. Observations (consolidated facts) would carry no document_id and report unavailable, but they are disabled per bank (see deviations)."
      },
      "delete": "native",
      "delete_notes": "DocumentsApi.delete_document(bank, document_id): deletes the document and every memory unit and link extracted from it in one transaction, and invalidates observations built on them (memory_engine.py delete_document). Re-retaining the same document_id replaces it (update_mode default 'replace').",
      "readiness": "retain is submitted with retain_async=true (as AMB does); /ingest polls OperationsApi.get_operation_status until completed or failed and then reads DocumentsApi.get_document().memory_unit_count; /finish polls OperationsApi.list_operations totals until in_flight = total - completed - failed is 0 (AMB `_in_flight_ops`), failed > 0 => degraded",
      "namespace": "bank (bank_id = ns); reset = BanksApi.delete_bank + create_bank",
      "parallel_namespaces": true,
      "retrieval_policies": {
        "vendor-default": {
          "settings": {
            "budget": "mid",
            "max_tokens": 4096,
            "include_chunks": false
          },
          "notes": "hindsight-client 0.10.2 `recall` defaults (hindsight_client.py:618-639): token-budgeted, not top-k. budget mid, max_tokens 4096 of fact text, chunks off, entities off, all fact types. query_timestamp is always the question date."
        },
        "fixed-evidence": {
          "settings": {
            "budget": "mid",
            "max_tokens": 8000,
            "include_chunks": false
          },
          "notes": "Same call with the fact-token cap raised to the shootout's 8,000-token evidence budget, so the harness packer, not memory-bank's 4,096 cap, decides what fits. memory-bank counts tokens with its own tokenizer, the harness with approxTokens; the packer truncates."
        },
        "allowed_settings_overrides": [
          "budget",
          "max_tokens",
          "include_chunks",
          "max_chunk_tokens",
          "types"
        ],
        "vendor_benchmark_reference": {
          "recall": {
            "budget": "high",
            "max_tokens": 32768,
            "include_chunks": true,
            "max_chunk_tokens": 16384,
            "include_entities": false
          },
          "notes": "What AMB's memory-bank provider sends for LoCoMo (`_recall_kwargs`); BEAM uses max_tokens 12288 and max_chunk_tokens 8192. Recorded for reference, not a shootout policy."
        },
        "item_mapping": "recall results in memory-bank's rank order: world and experience facts -> type fact, observations -> type observation, text = AMB `_format_result` ('**[type]** text' plus an occurred/mentioned line); with include_chunks, each chunk follows the first fact that cites it as a type chunk item (AMB inlines it there). valid_from/valid_to stay null: occurred_start/occurred_end are when an event happened, not a validity window, so they live in the text."
      },
      "streaming": "disabled",
      "provider_routes": [
        "POST /v1/chat/completions (retain extraction, OpenAI-compatible provider)",
        "POST /v1/embeddings (common config only)"
      ],
      "telemetry_off": [
        "HINDSIGHT_API_OTEL_TRACES_ENABLED=false",
        "HINDSIGHT_ENABLE_CP=false (control plane UI not started)",
        "HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1",
